Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> programa
Rule 1     programa -> instrucao
Rule 2     programa -> programa instrucao
Rule 3     instrucao -> let_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 4     instrucao -> fun_statement SEMICOLON
Rule 5     instrucao -> expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 6     let_statement -> LET ID COLON tipo ASSIGN expressao
Rule 7     let_statement -> LET ID ID ASSIGN expressao
Rule 8     fun_statement -> FUN ID COLON tipo ARROW tipo
Rule 9     expressao -> WHEN LPAREN expressao RPAREN IS cases END
Rule 10    cases -> case
Rule 11    cases -> cases case
Rule 12    case -> pattern_list ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 13    case -> UNDERSCORE ARROW expressao SEMICOLON
Rule 14    pattern_list -> pattern
Rule 15    pattern_list -> pattern_list COMMA pattern
Rule 16    pattern -> INT
Rule 17    pattern -> SUBTRACTION INT
Rule 18    pattern -> TRUE
Rule 19    pattern -> FALSE
Rule 20    pattern -> ID
Rule 21    expressao -> expressao SUM expressao
Rule 22    expressao -> expressao SUBTRACTION expressao
Rule 23    expressao -> expressao PRODUCT expressao
Rule 24    expressao -> expressao BAR expressao
Rule 25    expressao -> expressao EQUAL expressao
Rule 26    expressao -> expressao LESS expressao
Rule 27    expressao -> expressao GREATER expressao
Rule 28    expressao -> IF expressao THEN expressao ELSE expressao
Rule 29    expressao -> LPAREN expressao RPAREN
Rule 30    expressao -> INT
Rule 31    expressao -> TRUE
Rule 32    expressao -> FALSE
Rule 33    expressao -> ID LPAREN expressao RPAREN
Rule 34    expressao -> ID
Rule 35    tipo -> T_INT
Rule 36    tipo -> T_BOOL
Rule 37    expressao -> SUBTRACTION expressao

